<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - S. Barney starts Security Capital.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - S. Barney starts Security Capital.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney initiated coverage of Security Capital Atlantic Inc as neutral, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Security Capital, which develops and buys multifamily properties in the southeastern United States, launched its initial public offering in October.</p>
</text>
